      <node id="113348078744840255" label="puty fire chief in Swannanoa begs people to stop sharing misinformation&quot;This past weekend, a deputy fire chief in Swannanoa posted a strong message on the station's Facebook pleading with people to stop sharing misleading information. Deputy Chief Larry Pierson addressed the images and information that he has seen. He added context to some like the one of a refrigerated trailer being used by a funeral home. He said the facility didn't have electricity.&quot;https://abc11.com/post/helene-misinformation-western-nc-swannanoa-deputy-fire-chief-begs-public-stop-sharing-misleading-sensationalized-information/15450269/https://abc11.com/post/helene-misinformation-western-nc-swannanoa-deputy-fire-chief-begs-public-stop-sharing-misleading-sensationalized-information/15450269/https://abc11.com/post/helene-misinformation-western-nc-swannanoa-deputy-fire-chief-begs-public-stop-sharing-misleading-sensationalized-information/15450269/#Helene #NCwx #NCSTRONG #HurricaneHelene#HeleneHelene#NCwxNCwx#NCSTRONGNCSTRONG#HurricaneHeleneHurricaneHelene">
