      <node id="113342708261517420" label=" front of the window. This night, Skittle had received a new scratcher pad, and Cutie had taken over a box near the door. Fortunately, they were not in the cat tree as it was destroyed by the fallen real tree. The window was shattered and glass was everywhere. If they had been in the cat tree, they would have been injured.We were more concerned for our cats than all the thousands of dollars worth of computer and networking equipment in that room. We scooped up the cats and moved them to secure-ish areas. The electronics would come secondary.Skittle and Cutie were relocated to the TV Room with Rose and Pong. to hopefully be secure enough to ride out the hurricane winds/tornadoes..#Cat #Cats #Pets #ILoveCats #Kitty #Feline #Mastocats #FediCats #CatsOfFediverse #Catstodon#CatsOfMastodon #RescueCats#RescueCatsOfMastodon #HurricaneHelene#CatCat#CatsCats#PetsPets#ILoveCatsILoveCats#KittyKitty#FelineFeline#MastocatsMastocats#FediCatsFediCats#CatsOfFediverseCatsOfFediverse#CatstodonCatstodon#CatsOfMastodonCatsOfMastodon#RescueCatsRescueCats#RescueCatsOfMastodonRescueCatsOfMastodon#HurricaneHeleneHurricaneHelene">
