      <node id="113326132141732963" label="tored this evening.Massive thanks are extended to all the rural electrical co-ops from other states that have sent crews which are still working to restore power after Hurricane Helene.During the first week after the storm, 100% of my county was without power, and most roads were still blocked by fallen trees. I was unable to even get out of my driveway for three days until a neighbor used a chainsaw and a bulldozer to make a path to the main road.Fortunately, we had a generator and a limited supply of fuel until we could eventually make our way into our devastated little town for the meager supplies available.All the special-needs and rescue cats are safe. Fiber Internet is still offline for me, but I must give kudos to Starlink for being an excellent backup option.#Starlink #HurricaneHelene#StarlinkStarlink#HurricaneHeleneHurricaneHelene">
        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="2024-10-18 02:45:44+00:00" />
          <attvalue for="1" value="athos@tech.lgbt" />
          <attvalue for="2" value="0" />
