          <attvalue for="5" value="root" />
          <attvalue for="6" value="https://sunbeam.city/@planty/113325830301610039" />
          <attvalue for="7" value="1.0" />
        </attvalues>
      </node>
      <node id="113325791404822633" label=" did thanks to some folks from Canada!) They say we'll have internet by the 21st. Can't wait to be able to see the pictures everyone is posting and share some too. In Disaster Time I think this is Day 20. Cell signal is so bad that most of the time we can't use wikipedia or Google search. It's definitely brought perspective on how bloated the Internet has become. #hurricanehelene #appalachia #northcarolina#hurricanehelenehurricanehelene#appalachiaappalachia#northcarolinanorthcarolina">
