      <node id="113313530945781547" label="Rapid attribution shows the #hurricane would have been a much less damaging storm.This isn't a huge surprise, given that Milton traveled across the same exceptionally warm #GulfofMexico that #HurricaneHelene had recently transited. But the analysis does produce one striking result: Milton would have been a Category 2 storm at landfall if climate change weren't boosting its strength. https://arstechnica.com/science/2024/10/climate-change-boosted-miltons-landfall-strength-from-category-2-to-3/#ClimatechangeClimatechange#HurricaneMiltonHurricaneMilton#hurricanehurricane#GulfofMexicoGulfofMexico#HurricaneHeleneHurricaneHelenehttps://arstechnica.com/science/2024/10/climate-change-boosted-miltons-landfall-strength-from-category-2-to-3/https://arstechnica.com/science/2024/10/climate-change-boosted-miltons-landfall-strength-from-category-2-to-3/">
