      <node id="113231709849085201" label="#Governor of #NorthCarolina, #RoyCooper, and the #Federal #Government, are “going out of their way to not help people in #Republican areas” following #HurricaneHelene (1).#POTUSPOTUS#DonaldJTrumpDonaldJTrump#DemocratDemocrat#GovernorGovernor#NorthCarolinaNorthCarolina#RoyCooperRoyCooper#FederalFederal#GovernmentGovernment#RepublicanRepublican#HurricaneHeleneHurricaneHeleneRemember that every accusation is a confession. During the early period of #COVID the Republican #Trump #Administration reportedly baulked at a large-scale national plan in response to the #pandemic because the #virus seemed to initially favour #Democratic #states and was not (then) affecting Republican states (2, see also image).#COVIDCOVID#TrumpTrump#AdministrationAdministration#pandemicpandemic#virusvirus#DemocraticDemocratic#statesstatesHere in #Australia, we had a #conservative prime minister that in 2022 was faced with massive #floods and politicised the response to them: funding his party’s seats and states but not the other party’s seats and states (3). What happened to that prime minister is instructive: he led his party to the next #election and was soundly defeated: recording the worst result for Australia’s centre-right governing parties in seventy years.#AustraliaAustralia#conservativeconservative#floodsfloods#electionelection(1)&#09;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Aw7H6BLmtHg(2)&#09;https://www.nbcnews.com/think/opinion/did-trump-kushner-ignore-blue-state-covid-19-testing-deaths-ncna1235707(3)&#09;https://www.sstuwa.org.au/WesternTeacher/20/volume-513-april-2022/man-who-should-not-be-pmhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Aw7H6BLmtHghttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Aw7H6BLmtHghttps://www.nbcnews.com/think/opinion/did-trump-kushner-ignore-blue-state-covid-19-testing-deaths-ncna1235707https://www.nbcnews.com/think/opinion/did-trump-kushner-ignore-blue-state-covid-19-testing-deaths-ncna1235707https://www.sstuwa.org.au/WesternTeacher/20/volume-513-apri