      <node id="113224010380166514" label="casting, &amp; links for making donations. &quot;After catastrophes like this, 'stuff' is nice to donate but what is really needed is money.&quot;&quot;These more rural communities are likely to be dealing with this for a long time and will need a *lot* of help in the weeks &amp; months ahead, as the resources &amp; media attention don’t always focus on places like that.&quot;https://theeyewall.com/massive-recovery-ahead-due-to-helene-but-the-tropics-remain-somewhat-busy/https://theeyewall.com/massive-recovery-ahead-due-to-helene-but-the-tropics-remain-somewhat-busy/https://theeyewall.com/massive-recovery-ahead-due-to-helene-but-the-tropics-remain-somewhat-busy/#HurricaneHelene #Helene #donations #flood#HurricaneHeleneHurricaneHelene#HeleneHelene#donationsdonations#floodflood">
