      <node id="113222535004615028" label="Helene fades from terror to timid. Happily for us in northern Ohio, the storm's remains are simply damp and depressing. Many others, even far from the Gulf of Mexico, were hit devastatingly hard -- roads, homes, towns smashed or flooded, washed away. So a dreary Sunday here ain't so bad. We'll take it. And send our support, emotional and material, to our unfortunate fellow Americans.#HurricaneHelene#HurricaneHeleneHurricaneHelene">
