      <node id="113219506375725332" label="If you’re wondering why there isn’t more coverage of specific areas affected by #HurricaneHelene it is because news crews literally can’t get there. The French Broad River for example crested at 24.57 feet above flood stage in Asheville. The cleanup after this storm will take several years and possibly be the most expensive in US history. I had a bad feeling about this storm as soon as I saw the data pre-landfall. 💔#AshevilleAsheville#HurricaneHeleneHurricaneHelene">
