      <node id="113216451562457580" label="e, we ended up having to pull over soon and stay in a restaurant parking lot. Figure out what to do at dawn.🚨 Emergency vehicles all night.🌃 No traffic lights, no house lights, no business lights. We were in a new Dark Zone, so enjoyed unusually bright stars.I checked utility outage maps to find a tiny area with power - and a gas station. At dawn, we headed out. 🤞 #AshevilleNC #NCWx#HurricaneHelene #Helene#AshevilleNCAshevilleNC#NCWxNCWx#HurricaneHeleneHurricaneHelene#HeleneHelene">
        <attvalues>
