      <node id="113216373107689395" label=" going back due to road closings. They gave us water and invited us for dinner. It was very good!During the meal, two high-water rescues were made for people who tried to cross the floodwaters.We settled in for the night in our small car. Another rescue occurred. About 1 AM, though, flashing police cars signaled the road was clear. We followed into the dark unknown.#AshevilleNC #NCWx #HurricaneHelene #Helene#AshevilleNCAshevilleNC#NCWxNCWx#HurricaneHeleneHurricaneHelene#HeleneHelene">
