      <node id="113216320432376598" label="ning as the wind and rain died down. Otherwise, we could be delayed for days. #AshevilleNCAshevilleNCThe two major highways out were clear, unlike secondary roads, so we left quickly.Upon leaving, GPS re-routed us away from our preferred direction East. Interstate 40 had just flooded.So, South it was. Just minutes out, we witness the French Broad River overtop I-24. We turned around and parked.#NCWx #HurricaneHelene #Helene#NCWxNCWx#HurricaneHeleneHurricaneHelene#HeleneHelene">
