      <node id="113206092283743846" label="o get a trial-by-hurricane tonight. It's pretty neat; it collects temp, humidity, wind speed &amp; direction, &amp; rain, then sends that telemetry wirelessly to a panel in the house, which displays &amp; forwards it to wunderground.com. They then combine my data with all the other local sensors to provide better local data. There are 48 other home stations in my little town, which surprised me. #Weather #HurricaneHelene#WeatherWeather#HurricaneHeleneHurricaneHelene">
