      <node id="113201272214050463" label="Hurricane Helene. I will use the hashtag sparingly in this thread so that people who need to use it for help don't get diluted with my posts. Feel free to actively boost.I am in Saint Petersburg, FL. We will be about 125 miles (200 km) from the eye of the storm at its closest approach. We will likely get a lot of rain and tropical storm force winds. There will flooding in some nearby low-lying neighborhoods but we are about 50 ft (15 m) above sea level. We probably will lose electricity - we always seem to.#HurricaneHelene#Helene#Florida#wind#rain#flooding#hurricane#ClimateChange#HurricaneHeleneHurricaneHelene#HeleneHelene#FloridaFlorida#windwind#rainrain#floodingflooding#hurricanehurricane#ClimateChangeClimateChange">
