      <node id="113203208532090818" label="t! I've got a power backup!&quot;? You know, the ones with solar panel rechargers? (Jackery, Anker?) Not the tiny ones for phones.#HurricaneHeleneHurricaneHeleneThey're good for a few hours of use but remember: skies are very cloudy after hurricanes! Solar panels are useless for recharging the power banks in the hours during and after a hurricane. Most can recharge from the car (12v). Fill your tank!PLEASE plan accordingly! #Hurricane #Helene#HurricaneHurricane#HeleneHelene">
