      <node id="113203151458293893" label="ne1. PRECOOL your house by ~5-7℉! If you think power will go out, drop your thermostat now! It will help later today when power goes out! Helps w/humidity too!2. Fill your tank! Running your vehicle is an easy (tho expensive) source of charging your electronics throughout an extended blackout!3. Close blinds and curtains! It helps insulate house if power goes out.4. DL apps now! Things like Accuweather. #Helene #HurricaneHelene#HeleneHelene#HurricaneHeleneHurricaneHelene">
