      <node id="113404611291259286" label="CarolinaNorthCarolina#MitchellCountyMitchellCountyOfficial Update from Mitchell County Sheriff’s OfficeWe are deeply saddened to report that Mitchell County lost 5 citizens directly due to the impacts of Hurricane Helene, with 2 additional losses from storm-related incidents. Our thoughts and prayers are with the families and loved ones affected by these tragic events.At this time, one active missing persons case remains, and efforts are ongoing to locate them. However, all children in Mitchell County have been accounted for.Please remember, if you need assistance for non-emergency matters, call 828-688-9110. For emergencies, dial 911 immediately...https://www.facebook.com/share/v/bkr2cjmPKLhnDSjh/?mibextid=8O0DfKhttps://www.facebook.com/share/v/bkr2cjmPKLhnDSjh/?mibextid=8O0DfKhttps://www.facebook.com/share/v/bkr2cjmPKLhnDSjh/?mibextid=8O0DfK">
