      <node id="113404536848351427" label="rolinaFrom NC Emergency Management on FB: North Carolina Department of Transportation is closely monitoring travel conditions as #HeleneNC recovery continues in Western NC. Most highways in WNC are open, though some roads remain restricted. Before visiting, check with local communities for availability and use DriveNC.gov for safe route planning and real-time road updates.#HeleneNCHeleneNCFor more on the Western NC travel advisory visit: https://www.visitnc.com/advisory/cAdA/hurricane-helene-travel-advisory.https://www.visitnc.com/advisory/cAdA/hurricane-helene-travel-advisoryhttps://www.visitnc.com/advisory/cAdA/hurricane-helene-travel-advisory">
