      <node id="113392454015946453" label="hCarolina“Hi. Saw where you were going to feature Christmas trees farms. My husband and I own King’s Christmas Trees in Morganton. This is our 43rd year selling trees. Our trees are grown in Newland and Beech Mountain areas. We were able to get up last weekend to check on the trees, and thankfully, none are damaged. We have a crew that cuts and hauls to our tree lot daily. We will open Nov 16th.  Some have mentioned not wanting to go into the mountains to get in the way of disaster clean up, so they are welcome to stop by our lot in Morganton.”">
        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="2024-10-29 19:52:17+00:00" />
