      </node>
      <node id="113392446478746878" label="rolinaFrom NC’s Weather Authority on FB: Support Local Western North Carolina Christmas Tree Farmers: Here’s King's Christmas Trees, located in Morganton. All their Christmas trees are grown in Newland and Beech Mountain. The trees made it, and they’ll begin selling them at their lot in Morgantown on Nov 16th. This is their 43rd year. Please support them and all the Western NC Christmas Tree Farmers. Brenda King took these photos and shared me some information she is the owner.">
