      <node id="113390513765265995" label="NorthCarolinaNorthCarolina#BuncombeCountyBuncombeCountyFrom Buncombe County Government on FB: A new Disaster Recovery Disaster Recovery Center (DRC) is now open at Cane Creek Pool at 590 Lower Bush Creek Road in Fairview. This location is open daily from 8 a.m. to 7 p.m. A mobile disaster recovery center is at the Buncombe County Sports Park at 58 Apac Drive in Asheville open through Thursday from 9 a.m. to 5 p.m. A Disaster Recovery Center is a readily accessible facility or mobile office where applicants may go for information about disaster assistance programs. It serves as the &quot;face&quot; of FEMA to many disaster survivors.">
        <attvalues>
