      <node id="113390492558964453" label="rolinaNorthCarolina#BurkeCountyBurkeCountyFrom Burke County Government on FB: FEMA provides many types of disaster assistance to help survivors jumpstart their recovery.As each application is reviewed, eligibility is determined for different types of assistance based on the specific situation. If you have questions about your benefits, please attend one of the DSAs listed below, or you can visit the Disaster Recovery Center between 8 a.m. and 7 p.m. daily. The Disaster Recovery Center is located at Foothills Higher Education Center, 2128 South Sterling Street, Morganton, NC 28655. Read about what you may qualify for ➡️ http://fema.gov/.../10-items-fema-assistance-can-provide...http://fema.gov/.../10-items-fema-assistance-can-providehttp://fema.gov/.../10-items-fema-assistance-can-provide">
