      <node id="113390475564055447" label="#NorthCarolinaNorthCarolina#HendersonCountyHendersonCountyHenderson County residents who pre-registered for D-SNAP through the online portal by 4 p.m. on Oct. 24, 2024, but were unable to reach the call center to complete their interview, will receive a call from DSS officials by Nov. 1 to complete their application. NCDHHS asks those who have pre-registered to anticipate a call between now and Nov. 1 at the phone number they provided in the pre-registration application. The number calling may be from outside their local area code.The Resource Hub at 118 McAbee Court, Flat Rock, NC 28731, will be open from 10 a.m. to 6 p.m. on the following dates:TUE, OCT 29THU, OCT 31SAT, NOV 2">
