      <node id="113309791799895281" label="pictures of many fallen trees, and visited several of my favorites around town. All were intact except this old Hickory tree. It was massive, probably 60 feet tall and wide. The tree was lying across gravestones in the town's oldest cemetery, c. 1787. The passing of a legend, I thought to myself, and kept repeating, &quot;Wow. Wow!&quot; as I walked around the scene.I'll share a picture later today of the grand old tree I snapped last Autumn.#FediversalPictures #Photography #Helene#FediversalPicturesFediversalPictures#PhotographyPhotography#HeleneHelene">
