      <node id="113311763303580444" label="orthCarolinaNorthCarolina#HaywoodCountyHaywoodCountyFrom Haywood County Emergency Services on FB: Debris clean up efforts in Haywood County began Monday, October 14, 2024. Please follow the guidelines below for proper placement:• Place all debris on the right of way along the road.• Keep debris clear of fire hydrants, fences, mailboxes, and other obstacles to ensure safe andefficient removal.This will be the first pass of debris removal, and crews will make additional passes at a later time. To help us keep the process moving efficiently, please ensure your debris is out and ready for pickup by the time crews arrive in your area.">
