      <node id="113302803336915777" label="cup of water, starting with the cleanest dishes first. If they're oily/greasy, add a little detergent to the pre-wash water. If the end ones are still very dirty, give them a second pre-wash with 1/2 cup of water. Then warm 4 - 6 cups of water, add detergent, and wash as normal, starting with the least-dirty dishes.The pre-wash water will get horrible, but will make the dishes significantly cleaner, and make your dish water go a lot further. #disaster #helene #milton#disasterdisaster#helenehelene#miltonmilton">
