      <node id="113299813062703047" label="CarolinaNorthCarolina#HaywoodCountyHaywoodCounty[Captioned Video]The Haywood County curfew hours are being adjusted to 1:00 AM to 6:00 AM until further notice. Please be mindful of this change and limit travel during these hours to ensure your safety and the safety of others. Curfews are established under the county’s State of Emergency, in response to the impacts of Helene.  We appreciate your cooperation as recovery continues.    Stay safe, Haywood County.https://www.facebook.com/share/v/zy61cBj4wz29x3xy/?mibextid=8O0DfKhttps://www.facebook.com/share/v/zy61cBj4wz29x3xy/?mibextid=8O0DfKhttps://www.facebook.com/share/v/zy61cBj4wz29x3xy/?mibextid=8O0DfK">
