      <node id="113299803799678478" label="hCarolinaNorthCarolina#BurkeCountyBurkeCounty3️⃣ Separate Your Debris: Please move debris to the right of way and organize it into 3 piles: 🌿 Vegetation (tree branches, etc.),  White Goods (appliances), and 🏗️ Building Materials (construction debris).4️⃣ Keep it Clear: Place debris away from trees, fire hydrants, and other structures to ensure smooth removal.5️⃣ For Residents Only! Commercial properties aren’t eligible for this service – business owners will need to arrange separate debris removal.⚠️ Important Reminder: We encourage you not to bring debris to the landfill. But if you must, please make sure your load is secured to prevent litter!…">
