      <node id="113299798461978889" label="thCarolinaNorthCarolina#BurkeCountyBurkeCounty🚨 Burke County Debris Removal Alert! 🚨Clearing debris is a crucial part of recovery efforts in Burke County, and we’ve got you covered! 🌳🚜 Starting Monday, Oct. 14, debris pickup services will begin and continue for the coming weeks and months – at no cost to residents! 🙌1️⃣ Do NOT bring debris to the landfill! The county has hired a hauler to collect debris from residential areas directly, free of charge. Avoid landfill disposal fees!2️⃣ Debris Collection Process: No need to be home for the pickup! The hauler will tag debris and pass through 2-3 times to ensure everything is collected.">
