      <node id="113299746154695535" label="rolina…Natural disasters are traumatic for individuals, families and communities, and there is no right or wrong way to feel. There are resources available for any North Carolinian who needs support as the state recovers from Hurricane Helene. 📞  The national Disaster Distress Helpline - 1-800-985-5990❤️ Call, text or chat to 988👫  The statewide Peer Warmline - 1-855-PEERS NC (855-733-7762)📱 The Disability Disaster Hotline - 800-626-4959👮 Hope4NC Helpline for first responders - 1-855-587-3463 More information here: https://bit.ly/3Y5kSsGhttps://bit.ly/3Y5kSsGhttps://bit.ly/3Y5kSsG">
