      <node id="113294593573153625" label="ebbyDebbyfrom NWS Miami （@NWSMiami　X/Twitter）【　It has been a 3 month streak of South Florida receiving impacts from nearby hurricanes in the Gulf of Mexico.#Debby in August, #Helene in September, and most recently #Milton this past week. #DebbyDebby#HeleneHelene#MiltonMilton3 storms with vastly different impacts; a good example that every storm is different.　】↑https://x.com/nwsmiami/status/1845085258703831470?s=46https://x.com/nwsmiami/status/1845085258703831470?s=46https://x.com/nwsmiami/status/1845085258703831470?s=46">
