      <node id="113279016692874363" label=" currently allows you to do a &quot;round up to nearest donation&quot; to BeLoved Asheville to help with Hurricane Helene relief.Biblio itself is based in Asheville. All the stores listed on it are independent bookstores. as a book dealer, Biblio is always my first stop for ordering books for customers as it has comparable prices to Amazon but is just overall better in every measurable way other than &quot;omg I need instant shipping!&quot; Its offered that round up option for YEARS, it just rotates between book related charities every few months. So had everything in place to swap between charities as soon as Helene hit. BeLoved Asheville provided mobile food pantries and health service to provide for the unhoused prior to the hurricane. So are perfect option to provide that to newly unhoused folks in the aftermath.#books #bookstores #asheville #hurricanes #helenehttps://www.biblio.com/ currently allows you to do a &quot;round up to nearest donation&quot; to BeLoved Asheville to help with Hurricane Helene relief.Biblio itself is based in Asheville. All the stores listed on it are independent bookstores. as a book dealer, Biblio is always my first stop for ordering books for customers as it has comparable prices to Amazon but is just overall better in every measurable way other than &quot;omg I need instant shipping!&quot; Its offered that round up option for YEARS, it just rotates between book related charities every few months. So had everything in place to swap between charities as soon as Helene hit. BeLoved Asheville provided mobile food pantries and health service to provide for the unhoused prior to the hurricane. So are perfect option to provide that to newly unhoused folks in the aftermath.#books#bookstores#asheville#hurricanes#helene">
