      <node id="113273087255503222" label="t to the fediverse:i don't ever remember seeing a #hurricane take the path #Helene took. i consider it an incredibly abnormal path. to me, it moved more like a tornado. #hurricanehurricane#HeleneHelenehas anybody come across any commentary, articles or even pre-review papers addressing that?#Milton #Kirk #Irene are the common hurricane paths i’ve seen of my decades of paying attention to hurricanes. #Helene’s path was just whack.#MiltonMilton#KirkKirk#IreneIrene#HeleneHelene">
