      <node id="113272563142014337" label="NorthCarolinaNorthCarolina#MitchellCountyMitchellCountyFrom Mitchell County NC Government on FB: An exciting new resource is now open! The Volunteer Reception Center is open at the Senior Center. This program matches volunteers with people who need assistance.If you need assistance: Contact the center and let them know what type of assistance you need. For example, you need a tree cut out of your driveway.If you want to volunteer your help: Contact the center and let them know what skills and equipment you have that you can offer to help. For example, you have chainsaws and a wood splitter.">
