      <node id="113272527936529643" label="thCarolinaNorthCarolina#TownofBooneTownofBooneMaintain documentation of debris clean-up. This documentation can include pictures of the debris prior to and after clean-up efforts.Separate debris into five (5) piles:Construction debris (i.e. drywall, building materials, carpet, etc.)Vegetative debris (i.e. limbs, branches, plants, etc.)Large appliances (if applicable)Hazardous waste (i.e. oil, cleaning supplies, etc.)Electronics (if applicable)Please note: For the week of October 9th, SDR will collect only construction debris, large appliances, hazardous waste, and electronics. Vegetative debris will be collected at a later date. There is no set schedule for debris removal.">
        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="2024-10-08 15:33:11+00:00" />
