      <node id="113269628461227025" label="hCarolinaAs donations and efforts to provide humanitarian relief to Western North Carolina residents continue, local residents and those wishing to help are encouraged to tune into trusted local sources for the latest information on meal sites, points of distribution for commodities, and specific donation needs for counties. A list of reliable sources of local information and resources for each impacted North Carolina county is available at www.ncdps.gov/helene-local-links. For additional information on trusted sources go to: https://www.ncdps.gov/news/press-releases/2024/10/07/ncem-urges-western-nc-residents-follow-trusted-local-sources-information. #HeleneNChttps://www.ncdps.gov/news/press-releases/2024/10/07/ncem-urges-western-nc-residents-follow-trusted-local-sources-informationhttps://www.ncdps.gov/news/press-releases/2024/10/07/ncem-urges-western-nc-residents-follow-trusted-local-sources-information#HeleneNCHeleneNC">
