      <node id="113267331255542899" label="olinaNorthCarolina#RutherfordCountyRutherfordCounty• Visit www.ebtedge.com and log in or register.• Download the free ebtEDGE app on the Apple Store or Google Play.• Call 1-888-622-7328 to activate your PIN.VOLUNTEERS &amp; SUPPLIES:Your donations &amp; volunteer efforts have made a tremendous impact. We are currently at full capacity and do not need additional supplies at this time. We are transitioning to a single distribution site in Lake Lure and will provide more information as it becomes available. We will continue to share specific needs as they arise.MONETARY DONATIONS: 100% of contributions will go to disaster relief. Go to:rhilegacyfoundation.com and unitedwayofrutherford.org">
