      <node id="113267319952091062" label="rolinaNorthCarolina#RutherfordCountyRutherfordCountyLake Lure: Access near the Town Center is restricted. Residents may return home but must show proof of residency at checkpoints.MOBILE HEALTH CLINIC:Located at Rutherford County EMS Station on Bills Creek Road, Lake Lure. Open from 9:30 am to 4:30 pm, the clinic offers services for chronic disease management, prescriptions, minor strains and sprains, and flu/COVID testing.EBT BENEFITS:Rutherford County Food and Nutrition Services (FNS) participants now have replacement benefits on their EBT cards. The USDA approved 70% of the September benefit for participants in Rutherford County. This replacement is automatic; no action is needed.">
