      <node id="113264994189399134" label="orthCarolinaNorthCarolina#WataugaCountyWataugaCountyPhone service has increased across most of Western NC, and power and water are slowly being restored. While progress is being made, entire towns are wiped out, and the landscape will be forever changed. In some areas it’ll take months to years to recover fully. Once all the media attention leaves, I plan to do some monthly check-in on damage and progress and share some updates here and there.">
        <attvalues>
