      <node id="113264989433858971" label="orthCarolinaNorthCarolina#WataugaCountyWataugaCountyFrom North Carolina’s Weather Authority on FB: WATAUGA COUNTY: Widespread damage occurred throughout Watauga, too. Helene, a follower, shared these photos from the Sugar Grove and Cove Creek area of Watauga County. She says several bridges were washed, and folks are working to rebuild temporary bridges so people can easily get out. There is still no running water or power, but progress is being made. As of 3 PM, 150K customers across Western North Carolina remain without power, and progress is definitely being made.-Ethan">
