      <node id="113264967115770158" label="x#NorthCarolinaNorthCarolina#RutherfordCountyRutherfordCountyVOLUNTEER ASSISTANCE: While we deeply appreciate the community's willingness to help, volunteer aid in the Chimney Rock area is not needed at this time. Professional contractors are working to clear roads and debris, a necessary first step to create safe conditions for any future volunteer efforts. We will communicate when volunteers are needed and it is safe to do so.">
