      <node id="113264942467776274" label="x#NorthCarolinaNorthCarolina#RutherfordCountyRutherfordCountyFrom Rutherford County Government, NC on FB:📰 Sunday morning news and information from Chimney Rock Village NC ⤵️We are aware of several false reports regarding the Village and surrounding area and want to address these directly. Please share this information.NO GOVERNMENT SEIZURE OF CHIMNEY ROCK:  There have been no discussions or actions taken by the federal, state, or local government related to property seizure in Chimney Rock. There was no &quot;special meeting&quot; held in Chimney Rock on Oct. 2nd involving discussions of the federal, state, or local governments seizing the Village. These claims are entirely false.">
