      <node id="113264963018594500" label="x#NorthCarolinaNorthCarolina#RutherfordCountyRutherfordCountyRESIDENTS AND PROPERTY OWNERS: When it is safe, residents and owners will be allowed to visit their properties. They will have to show proof of ownership or residency. At present, Main Street is being used by large construction equipment to rebuild US Hwy 74A/64/9 through the village. Secondary streets including Terrace Drive have to remain open for essential traffic. These streets are predominantly single lane. As soon as possible, a procedure will be established to allow residents and owners to visit their property.">
