      <node id="113264956802329784" label="x#NorthCarolinaNorthCarolina#RutherfordCountyRutherfordCountyTown of Lake Lure &amp; Chimney Rock Village officials met with NC House Speaker Tim Moore, NC Senator Tim Moffitt, NC Rep Jake Johnson, Sheriff Aaron Ellenburg, County Commissioner Chair Bryan King, Emergency Mgt Director Frankie Hamrick, &amp; reps from our congressional delegation to offer them an opportunity to hear directly the impact to their individual municipalities…FATALITIES: 1 in Chimney Rock VillageClaims of &quot;bodies everywhere&quot; are completely unfounded. Our emergency services and professional contractors are working tirelessly to clear debris &amp; ensure the safety of residents.">
