      <node id="113256915433588291" label="hCarolinaNorthCarolinain coordination with the Division of Waste Management, Inactive Hazardous Sites Branch. Regional contact is Brett Engard, (828) 767-2424 or brett.engard@deq.nc.gov It is recommended that material not be placed back in a flood prone area and that adequate runoff controls (silt fence, etc) be installed around the stockpiles. These guidelines are subject to change as more information becomes available from local, state, or federal partners on the overall management of debris. Additional information can be obtained by contacting the Division of Waste Management at 828-296-4500. #HurricaneHeleneNC#HurricaneHeleneNCHurricaneHeleneNC">
