      <node id="113256779468090089" label="NorthCarolinaNorthCarolina#MitchellCountyMitchellCountyCLINICS: Mountain Community Health Partnership (MCHP) clinics are open 10 a.m. to noon to write prescriptions at: Spruce Pine (Grassy Creek), Bakersville, Burnsville, &amp; Celo.SHELTER: A doctor &amp; nurse are visiting the shelter at Mitchell High daily to check on people &amp; write prescriptions.HEALTH DEPT: Mitchell Co Health Dept will open MON 8 a.m. to 4 p.m. providing treatment of minor issues (colds, sore throat, etc.), medicine refills, &amp; vaccines.DIALYSIS: Davita Dialysis is open 5 a.m. to 5 p.m.OXYGEN: If you use oxygen, limited tank exchanges are available at Mitchell HS &amp; the Bakersville &amp; Spruce Pine Fire dept.">
