      <node id="113256757008246158" label="ne#NCwxNCwx#NorthCarolinaNorthCarolina#MitchellCountyMitchellCountyFrom Mitchell County, NC Government on FB: Good Morning, Mitchell County!Here are some healthcare updates:PHARMACIES: The following pharmacies are open: Roan Mountain Pharmacy, Hospital Drive, Walmart, Blue Ridge Regional Hospital Pharmacy, and the Prescription Pad. Please have your medication bottle(s), date of birth, and address when you go to the pharmacy.HOSPITAL: The hospital is open. Water and sewer are still an issue, but they are functioning.">
