      <node id="113253853271881817" label="ures &amp; mist them too. Make or buy thieves blend to mist with. Papers &amp; photos can be saved even if they’ve molded. Rinse &amp; mist them as well. I lived thru some bad hurricanes in Houston. Do your vehicles too. Trust me this works. It kills even black mold at the roots not just on the surface like bleach. (Pets need to be kept away from strong odors btw, give it a couple of days)  #Helene #flooding #Mold@ai6yr@ai6yrai6yr#HeleneHelene#floodingflooding#MoldMold">
