      <node id="113252821676553087" label="cooked meals (sample pictured) to subscribers every weekday. Texted the chef/owner today about our appointment Monday and she called me.The lack of electricity after #Helene has bankrupted the company. Her prepared meals for last Friday spoiled, along with a large market order she'd just taken delivery on. Unless she can raise many thousands and soon, it's over.#HeleneHeleneI didn't know what to say except the usual, &quot;I'm so sorry&quot; and that felt horribly inadequate.Her story won't make the news, so I thought I'd tell it here.The food was amazing.">
        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="2024-10-05 04:01:54+00:00" />
