      <node id="113250418609711564" label="ereNotGoingBack #HarrisWalz2024HarrisWalz2024#WereNotGoingBackWereNotGoingBackStill no water, power, connection, communication, feeling forgotten.The last thing I downloaded before #Helene hit was the new #TheCure song ALONE, and it’s been my soundtrack all through this. Thank you, #RobertSmith !🌈💜🌈#HeleneHelene#TheCureTheCure#RobertSmithRobertSmithPeople are still talking like this is gonna be 3-4 weeks, but I think 5-10 years just to achieve baseline, and we’ve NEVER had any real infrastructure here.Now they’re seeing the cost.OMG i have a zillion thoughts to share on a zillion topics, i have been so lonely and isolated, and it has been driving me NUTS! Feels like we’re at a scary juncture. People are getting desperate and frustrated.#AVL #Asheville#AVLAVL#AshevilleAsheville">
