      <node id="113248777530752426" label=" Frontier #Nurses of #Kentucky.#GenealogyGenealogy#NursesNurses#KentuckyKentuckyThe Frontier Nursing Service (FNS) provides #healthcare services to rural, underserved populations since 1925, and educates nurse-midwives since 1939.#healthcarehealthcarehttps://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Frontier_Nursing_Servicehttps://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Frontier_Nursing_Servicehttps://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Frontier_Nursing_ServiceDocumentary: Angels on Horseback. https://www.pbs.org/video/angels-on-horseback-midwives-in-the-mountains-u2dhfg/https://www.pbs.org/video/angels-on-horseback-midwives-in-the-mountains-u2dhfg/https://www.pbs.org/video/angels-on-horseback-midwives-in-the-mountains-u2dhfg/#Helene #HeleneRelief #Appalachia #Appalachians#HeleneHelene#HeleneReliefHeleneRelief#AppalachiaAppalachia#AppalachiansAppalachians">
