      <node id="113248670549623253" label="CarolinaNorthCarolina…dewpoints are expected to reach close to temps in the morning, thus a high relative humidity, there could be low-lying fog in some areas across the state during breakfast time. Model guidance shows some spotty showers across the mountains in the morning &amp; then a line of scattered storms popping up in Western NC starting around 2 pm then strengthening throughout the evening, reaching as far as Hickory &amp; Winston-Salem before dissipating around 9pm. These later storms could produce some pockets of rain &amp; gusty winds near the Winston &amp; Hickory areas. Overall just a few scattered showers &amp; maybe a storm today. Have a great rest of your FRI…">
        <attvalues>
