      <node id="113248658011499582" label="r Authority:#HeleneHelene#NCwxNCwx#NorthCarolinaNorthCarolinaHappy Friday, North Carolina! Today is a gift, so be joyful! I hope everyone has a great start to your weekend. The weather looks pleasant for football games all across the state. Highs across the state will run in the 70s to the low 80s, while lows will run in the mid to low 60s. Dewpoints (moisture in the air) will run in the low 60s in the morning and then reach the mid-60s later across the state, so expect moderately humid conditions throughout the afternoon.">
