      <node id="113246375492802061" label="#NorthCarolinaNorthCarolina#McDowellCountyMcDowellCountyNow, our teams are conducting secondary searches, utilizing specialized resources such as search dogs and drones to thoroughly check areas that were previously cleared, ensuring that any missing or hard-to-reach individuals are located.After Tropical Storm Helene, it's important to rely on trusted sources like NCEM, McDowell County EMS, McDowell County 911 / Emergency Management, and official channels for accurate information. Double-check before sharing any information online.">
