      <node id="113246369172806977" label="NorthCarolinaNorthCarolina#McDowellCountyMcDowellCountyFrom McDowell County 911/Emergency Management on FB:McDowell County has received 330 missing persons reports through our call center and the online reporting form. As of this morning, 309 individuals have been safely accounted for, and their families have been notified.We continue to prioritize search and rescue efforts and are working around the clock to search for missing persons. Our primary search efforts focused on locating individuals who were easily contactable and visibly in need of assistance.">
