      <node id="113246353416364930" label="CarolinaNorthCarolina#HaywoodCountyHaywoodCountyFrom Haywood County NC Government on FB:In light of the recent impacts from Helene, we want to remind everyone that the 988 Crisis Line is available for anyone experiencing mental health challenges or emotional distress. This service is free and connects you with trained counselors who can provide support. If you or someone you know needs help, please don’t hesitate to reach out. You are not alone, and assistance is just a call away. Call or text 988 or chat at 988lifeline.org.  Stay safe and take care of yourselves and each other.">
