      <node id="113244561582335245" label="rolinaNorthCarolinaNC Emergency Management As response to Hurricane Helene continues and recovery intensifies, many local donation drives have been organized to provide donations to Western North Carolina residents in need. The North Carolina Disaster Relief Fund, managed by United Way of North Carolina, is accepting contributions at www.nc.gov/donate. These funds will provide vital grants to nonprofits aiding impacted communities.For additional details and tips on donating safely go to: https://www.ncdps.gov/news/press-releases/2024/10/02/best-ways-donate-wake-hurricane-helene. #HeleneNChttps://www.ncdps.gov/news/press-releases/2024/10/02/best-ways-donate-wake-hurricane-helenehttps://www.ncdps.gov/news/press-releases/2024/10/02/best-ways-donate-wake-hurricane-helene#HeleneNCHeleneNC">
