      <node id="113243471546225307" label=" from flooding and heat, new research suggests that those who remain will be older, poorer and more vulnerable. https://www.propublica.org/article/climate-change-migration-hurricane-helenehttps://www.propublica.org/article/climate-change-migration-hurricane-helenehttps://www.propublica.org/article/climate-change-migration-hurricane-helene&quot;Many of the effects of climate change on American life will be subtle and unexpected. The future demographics of this country might look entirely unfamiliar. It’s past time to give real thought to who might get left behind.&quot;#climatechange #hurricane #Helene #climatecrisis#climatechangeclimatechange#hurricanehurricane#HeleneHelene#climatecrisisclimatecrisis">
