      <node id="113243299443316068" label="9/30. What do your characters do when feeling playful? Do they have games?Doesn’t appear in the text of either book in this series. Many of the MCs have essential crafts they do when they’re not otherwise occupied. It’s 1848 and brass cartridges are a rarity. Diane’s down-time activity is rolling cartridges. Any writes her endless notes, logs, journals, and accounts. (Delayed by #helene)#helenehelene">
