      <node id="113243293186021918" label="9/29. Has your enjoyment of reading changed since starting to write? How?Not significantly. I don’t read thoughtfully or critically. I become absorbed and rarely reflect on the craftsmanship. The consequence of this is I’m a relatively poor reader and worse writer.(Delayed by #helene)#helenehelene">
