      <node id="113242053995551417" label=", Dr. Michael Wehner, found that climate change increased Helene’s rainfall by 50% in some locations. That means a storm in 1900 that produced 20 inches, can produce 30 inches today. In this way, climate change transforms an already severe flood into a catastrophic one.&quot;#Helene #climateChange #climateCrisis #society #Election2024 #HeleneHelene#climateChangeclimateChange#climateCrisisclimateCrisis#societysociety#Election2024Election2024https://www.wfla.com/weather/climate-classroom/how-hurricane-helene-morphed-into-a-life-changing-storm/https://www.wfla.com/weather/climate-classroom/how-hurricane-helene-morphed-into-a-life-changing-storm/https://www.wfla.com/weather/climate-classroom/how-hurricane-helene-morphed-into-a-life-changing-storm/Research linkhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/14oq65lavZ7ho3-gdxE-tutDEcsxSHfUj/viewhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/14oq65lavZ7ho3-gdxE-tutDEcsxSHfUj/viewhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/14oq65lavZ7ho3-gdxE-tutDEcsxSHfUj/view">
