      <node id="113241555416411406" label="op off at Florence Baptist Church, 201 S Broadway St, Forest City, NC 28043.2. Monetary Donations: Visitwww.unitedwayofrutherford.org and ensure your donation is designated for Rutherford. Donations are tax-deductible.3. Clean-Up Volunteers: Sign up with BaptistsRUTHERFORDEST COUNTY, NC 1779on Mission and select Rutherford County as the preferred location:https://baptistsonmission.org/hurricane-helene-volunteer.4. Shipping Smaller Boxes (Amazon): Send items to 193 Callahan Koon Road, Spindale, NC 28160.5. EOC Food/Supplies Distribution Centers: Open daily from 9:00 am to 6:00 pm. For questions about donating items, call 828-278-8920.Florence Baptist Church: 201 S Broadway St, Forest City, NC 28043Rutherford County Health Department: 221 Callahan Koon Rd, Spindale, NC 28160 Thomas Jefferson High School: 2527 US-221A Hwy, Mooresboro, NC 28114 Gilkey Church of God: 255 Oak Springs Rd, Rutherfordton, NC 281396. Meals, Showers, and Water:оOOLake Lure Baptist Church: 6837 US-74 ALT, Lake Lure, NC 28746Shower trailer, bathrooms, supplies, and hot meals daily from 12:00 to 5:00 pm. Ingles in Lake Lure: Meals available from 11:30 am to 1:00 pm and 5:00 to 6:30 pm. Father's Vineyard: 724 Oakland Rd, Spindale, NCOpen 8:00 am to 1:00 pm for showers and phone charging.Fill water containers (up to 5 gallons per family).Serving spaghetti from 5:00 to 7:00 pm on Tuesday, October 1st.Spencer Baptist Church: 187 N Oak St, Spindale, NC 28160Water container filling available Monday to Friday, 9:00 am to 5:00 pm.O United Way of Rutherford County: 668 Withrow Rd, Forest CityPhone charging and water container filling available.7. Drinking Water: Broad River Water Authority and the Town of Forest City have tested and verified that water is safe for drinking.8. Missing People: To report missing loved ones or request a welfare check, call NC 211 (or 1-888- 892-1162 if calling from out-of-state) or email EOC@rutherfordcountync.gov.9. Home Damage: If your home is damaged and you need assistance with clean-up, contact Crisis Cleanup at 844-965-1386 for access to volunteer organizations.10. Emergency Shelter: RS Central High School. 641 US-221, Rutherfordton, NC 28139#HeleneHelene#RutherfordRutherfordhttps://baptistsonmission.org/hurricane-helene-volunteerhttps://baptistsonmission.org/hurricane-helene-volunteer">
