      <node id="113241552914204099" label="s are in my blood and my bones.I see pictures of the devastation across the mountains and I flash back to Katrina. Coming home to where there was once vibrant life. Grey where it had been green. Silent where once birds and dogs and children could be heard.To the survivors of #Helene's devastation in my home state I cannot say much, except: We are with you. And like the mountains you call home, you will endure. /2#HeleneHelene">
