      <node id="113239179024918054" label="linaNorthCarolina#BuncombeCountyBuncombeCountyFrom Buncombe County Government 1:00 pm edt:🚨 Hurricane Helene: Water and Food Distribution Updates 🚨As our community recovers from Hurricane Helene, we want to inform you of important resources available for water and meals:Distribution Centers: Today from 12-4 p.m., the following locations will provide drinking water and ready-to-eat meals. Please bring your own containers for water, as supplies are limited. Donations will not be accepted at these sites. If you would like to donate, please email helenedonations@buncombecounty.org.">
