      <node id="113239197942689408" label="wxNCwx#NorthCarolinaNorthCarolina#BuncombeCountyBuncombeCounty- Carolina Day School: Water distribution from 10 AM to 5 PM at 1345 Hendersonville Road. Each person can receive 6 bottles or 1 gallon of water. Distribution will continue until supplies run out.- First Baptist Church in Weaverville: Free meal opportunities starting at 1 p.m. (and continuing while supplies last). First Baptist Church in Weaverville is located at 63 North Main Street. The current plan is to continue this daily as possible, and their volunteer team will provide updates if there are any changes or added resources.Stay safe and support each other during this recovery process.">
