      <node id="113238509792364394" label="hour from home.Back at home in our part of Polk County,NC there is still no power, no cell phone service no Internet. Water is working, if you aren’t on a well.We are one of few in our ‘hood that has a generator, so have been able to help out our neighbors. Everyone is helping everyone💞Everything is on and working in Greenville, SC where drove for supplies. Stores stocked, gas available, most businesses open, good cellular. Headed back into the Dark Zone. Will check back when i can! We are so much better off than so many. Please keep supporting #NC recovery if you can.#Helene #WNC#NCNC#HeleneHelene#WNCWNC">
        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="2024-10-02 15:22:13+00:00" />
