      <node id="113237719137172678" label="s sure I knew something in particular about #Ashville but couldn't place it. Well, they mention it in this ars technica article - that is where NOAA's National Climatic Data Center NCDC is located. I have used this service a lot over the years and have talked with staff there. The irony of a climate data center going offline because of flooding resulting from #ClimateChange is not lost on me.https://arstechnica.com/science/2024/09/were-only-beginning-to-understand-the-historic-nature-of-helenes-flooding/#HeleneHelene#AshvilleAshville#ClimateChangeClimateChangehttps://arstechnica.com/science/2024/09/were-only-beginning-to-understand-the-historic-nature-of-helenes-flooding/https://arstechnica.com/science/2024/09/were-only-beginning-to-understand-the-historic-nature-of-helenes-flooding/">
