      <node id="113237699913889268" label="eleased a report on our ability to predict extreme rainfall:https://nap.nationalacademies.org/read/27460/chapter/1https://nap.nationalacademies.org/read/27460/chapter/1https://nap.nationalacademies.org/read/27460/chapter/1It's not an encouraging document.Current extreme rain models are based on decades-old science and ignore the climate crisis.The report does include a thoughtful plan for NOAA, the U.S. Corps of Engineers and many other public and private organizations to fix this problem over the next decade.#climatecrisis #hurricane #Helene#climatecrisisclimatecrisis#hurricanehurricane#HeleneHelene">
