      <node id="113232901869016305" label="om North Carolina’s Weather Authority 10:30 pm edt: Progress: Slowly but surely, power is being restored to Western North Carolina. This morning, power outages dropped below 400k, down from nearly 1 million during the height of Helene. Unfortunately, some power outages will last weeks in the hardest-hit areas of the mountains. As the power grid has to be rebuilt, they’re working as hard as possible to get everyone back online.">
