      <node id="113232837908089128" label="olinaNorthCarolinaBecause of the conditions in the mountains and the way the team will be moving around, that is hard to coordinate. I will bring a trailer to the Food Lion shopping center this afternoon at approximately 4pm if there is anyone in the area that wants to add to the supplies we are bringing! Please let me know if this is something you'd like to do, and we can be there between 4-5pm today to collect what you have!! God bless you all, and thank you for keeping prayers lifted up!!🙏🏻🙏🏻Food Lion 11745 Statesville BlvdCleveland, NC">
