      <node id="113228917010472567" label="inaNorthCarolina#RutherfordCountyRutherfordCountyfrom Rutherford County NC Emergency Management 1:30 pm edt:We have compiled a list of individuals who have been evacuated to the Rutherford County Emergency Shelter due to Hurricane Helene. This list has been created to the best of our abilities at the shelter, though some names may be misspelled. We will continue to update it as new individuals arrive. Please note that some individuals may have left the shelter voluntarily after their arrival.The shelter is located at RS Central High School, 641 US-221, Rutherfordton, NC 28139, at the back of the building">
