      <node id="113228879624194854" label="aywoodCountyHaywoodCountyFrom Haywood County Government 4:30 pm edtThe Pigeon Community Center, located at 450 Pigeon St, Waynesville, is now open as a welcome center to assist… The center is open every day from 9 a.m. to 4 p.m.Meals: Food will be served daily at 2 p.m.Resources: The center has water, power, charging stations, shovels, trash bags, and pet food available.Donations: If you have food donations, you can drop them off at the center to be cooked and distributed to those in need.Volunteer OpportunityThere will be a volunteer meeting tomorrow at 9 a.m. at the First Baptist Church of Waynesville. If you’d like to help, please attend the meeting.">
