      <node id="113228078439132219" label="NorthCarolinaNorthCarolina#NCwxNCwx#TransylvaniaCountyTransylvaniaCountyAnchor Baptist is coordinating volunteer efforts and is accepting donations to support those efforts.  Please reach out to Anchor directly with donations or volunteer availability. • Solid waste disposal sites for debris and spoiled food will open on Monday throughout the county.  Locations include Anchor Baptist, Pisgah Forest Convenience Site, See Off Convenience Site, Zion Church in Rosman, and the parking area between County Tax Office and Library in Brevard.• Dispose of any food that has been in contact with flood waters or not properly refrigerated. If in doubt, throw it out.">
