      <node id="113227967245856963" label="arolinaNotthCarolina#TransylvaniaCountyTransylvaniaCountyFrom Transylvania County FB:IMMEDIATE RELEASE- Transylvania County Unified Emergency Response to Hurricane HeleneSeptember 30, 2024  11 AM- Next update September 30 eveningIssued by:  Jaime Laughter, County Manager/Emergency Mgmt Public Information Officer• The county is working to restore non-emergency services and will provide an update this evening for services that will be available on Tuesday.• Transylvania County Schools will be closed for the remainder of the week.  • Today at 1 p.m., Smoke On and Gordingos will provide a free meal in the parking lot next to Champion Pool in Rosman.">
