      <node id="113227669180952813" label="ugaCounty#NorthCarolinaNorthCarolinaShelter options:-In coordination with the Red Cross, an Emergency Shelter for students and community members is located at the Holmes Convocation Center, located at 111 Rivers Street. This shelter has food, water and dry beds available now. -Off-campus students, faculty and staff in need of shelter should call 1-800-RED-CROSS (733-2767).Water:-The Town of Boone is currently under a Boil Water Advisory. All Town of Boone water customers are asked to boil water for 1 minute.-Please continue to check this page for information about water distribution in the town and county.">
