      <node id="113223585214042839" label="CountyWilkesCountyWilkes County Emergency Management is coordinating an Emergency Shelter in order to provide citizens a place to charge their electronic devices, take showers, or stay.  The location of this shelter will be at West Wilkes Middle School, located at 1677 N. Hwy 16, Millers Creek, NC.  The shelter will be open and operating at 3:00 pm today.  Wilkes County Animal Control will also be on site to assist individuals with pets that need to use the shelter.  Please share this information with individuals in need that have been impacted by this storm.">
