      <node id="113223182401013740" label="er and over again in my head the past few days. What happened in Bat Cave, Chimney Rock, Lake Lure and Gerton is beyond imaginable. Nothing prepared us for the disaster that took place here. People have lost everything, including ourselves. We fought for our lives on Friday and are so grateful the MANY people who helped make that happen. We owe so many people our lives and I’ll never be able to express the gratitude I feel towards our community. I want everyone to know how bad this really was. People are still there and are in dire need of help. The word needs to be spread about the catastrophic events that occurred. There is no way in or out.&quot;#NCNC#floodflood#HeleneHelene">
