      <node id="113222335179256995" label="or the oven to work, but I could light the burners with a match and cook in an outage. I wanted to ditch it for induction. It turns out I could. I have a 120v induction hotplate/hob, and the generator easily handles that. It can also run the air fryer and microwave, though it might be pushing it a bit to try running them all at once. Anyway, I can cook in an outage, and the propane is gone. #Helene#HeleneHelene">
