      <node id="113222184987552887" label="anagement Agency on FaceBook 1:00 pm edt: While local communities appreciate the volunteer spirit during disasters, please DO NOT send donations that have not been requested by state or local authorities.TEMA is not accepting volunteers or donations until the life safety mission is complete. TN, do not self-deploy to disaster areas - this will hinder response and recovery operations.A fund with the East TN Foundation has been established for monetary donations for impacted counties: https://easttennesseefoundation.orghttps://easttennesseefoundation.orghttps://easttennesseefoundation.orgTEMA works with the TN Voluntary Organizations Active in Disasters (TNVOAD).  For more information: https://tnvoad.org/how-to-help/ https://tnvoad.org/how-to-help/https://tnvoad.org/how-to-help/@AE4WX@AE4WX@AE4WXAE4WX">
