      <node id="113222041658727268" label="m South Toe Fire and Rescue 0700 am edt: [we] have started a new [Facebook page].We are seeing many welfare request in Burnsville Hub for our community and want to use this page to reach out to those requesting. Our county is devastated and we will do our best to answer each request. Our only way in and out of south toe at this time is 80s from Micaville. It is 4wd only on 80s with one lane north of poplar grove and we ask that anyone that does not have an emergency to not utilize this access. If we lose this access we will be cut off without any chance of receiving resources. We ask if you don’t need to be out please stay at home.">
