      <node id="113221857341235916" label="huge many thousand dollar whole house generator. For me the biggest power draw is the well pump, so I need a generator that can handle that, and at 240 volts.I replaced that first Craigslist generator last spring, as generator technology has now improved. Now there are inverter generators. These are quieter and far more efficient during periods of low draw. I use way less gas now. #Helene#HeleneHelene">
