      <node id="113221413526122808" label="From Carolina Climbers Coalition 10:40 am edt: Our hearts are broken at the destruction brought by Helene. We have received your messages asking how you can help. Thank you for reaching out and wanting to take positive action. At this time, unauthorized travel to these regions is irresponsible and could get in the way of emergency personnel. However, when the time is right, we will sound the alarm and rally our climbing community to aid in the recovery effort.For now, we are sharing resources and suggestions for supporting the greater recovery efforts :🔴 United Way has created a fund to help those affected by Helene. https://www.unitedwaync.org/https://www.unitedwaync.org/https://www.unitedwaync.org/">
