      <node id="113221381648450219" label="ystem: - The NC Department of Environmental Quality (DEQ) has issued a NO FLUSH ORDER for the area, though we realize most homes are without power and cannot flush at this point. - A BOIL ADVISORY has also been ordered, athough we also realize most homes do not have a mechanism to boil water yet. - All Town wells are operating except two. Staff are working to restore these wells as quickly as possible. Thank you to all those who are assisting in this devastating situation! Thank you to the community for taking care of each other and sharing resources...">
