      <node id="113221362926242376" label="aFrom Town of Lake Lure, NC9/28/25 7PM Updates: 1) Cell and internet service remains extremely challenging. The Town has requested emergency equipment to assist with this situation. This post may be delayed due to limited internet access. 2) Egress/Ingress for Lake Lure. - Please do not come to the area unless you absolutely need to be here. - Crews worked extremely hard to clear one lane which is now passable through Lake Lure on Memorial Highway; however, traffic is limited due to vast distraction in the area. -Highway 9 is open through LL to McQuinns‘s store, just passed Sunnyview.">
