      <node id="113221376257905367" label=":- Schnabel Engineers have conducted an assessment and have identified a plan for repairs but THE DAM REMAINS STABLE. - FEMA is coming in to assess the situation. 4) Clean-up: - The National Guard is in Tien and they are assisting with cleanup. - Multiple contractors are assisting staff with clean-up efforts. The priority is clearing primary roadways. - Overhead photos were taken today of the entire area to help assess the damage and to aid in developing a plan of action for clean-up.">
