      <node id="113221370118794717" label="am has been compromised and the road is not passable or safe beyond this point. We have been advised that the bridge will be out for some time. - We have been advised that there is a route out of Lake Lure on Highway 9 to Big Level Road (in Sunnyview), then take Highway 108 to I-26. We do not have information regarding I-26. - Another potential route is 64/74 headed from Lake Lure to Rutherfordton. The road was opened today and is no longer blocked at Bills Creek Road. The Rutherford Sheriff Department advised the road was now open through to Rutherfordton.">
