      <node id="113221324256022705" label="m NCDOT on Facebook 10:00am EDT: Despite the current weather, #Helene-related dangers are still very much a factor in Western NC. #HeleneHelene⚠️ ~300 road incidents remain - including +50 on main roads. Please refrain from travel for non-emergency purposes.📸 - US 70 near Silver Creek📸 - I-40 near Black Mountain">
