      <node id="113221292788672643" label="om Rutherford County, NC Update on Facebook – September 29, 2024, 9:00 AMWe are continuing to log all missing persons’ requests as evacuations are still happening. The internet has been down, so emails from EOC@rutherfordcountync.gov couldn’t be received or answered. Thankfully, internet and phone services are starting to get better, so we can communicate again. Please know that we understand how difficult this is, and we are carefully tracking all specific requests for missing individuals.">
