      <node id="113221283168608907" label="m Cherokee One Feathet on Facebook 8:20 am EDT: Per North Carolina Emergency Management:Need to contact a loved one after Hurricane Helene?Because the storm caused widespread power outages and impacted cell service, a phone call may not get through. But there are other options to try.* Use Facebook's Crisis Response to mark yourself as safe and to check in on others.* Send a message. While a phone call may not connect, a text or even an email may be successful.* Connect with NC211 or the Red Cross to learn about reunification resources.">
