      <node id="113217849869653460" label="e residents -cut off from comm. Towns in western NC, were transformed overnight by the massive storm. Muddy floodwaters lifted homes from their foundations. Landslides &amp; overflowing rivers severed the only way in &amp; out. Rescuers struggled to respond to the high number of emergency calls. Buncombe Co conducted &gt;150 rescues -they'd continue working overnight.Donate⬆️or to others.#HeleneHelene#ClimateCrisishttps://wapo.st/3XZuarr#ClimateCrisisClimateCrisishttps://wapo.st/3XZuarrhttps://wapo.st/3XZuarr">
