      <node id="113216721921659435" label="e Lure / Chimney Rock Village Area Rescue Operations - Emergency Management has successfully secured multiple air rescue resources to airlift citizens out of the Lake Lure / Chimney Rock Village area. Once evacuated, individuals will be transported to RS Central High School, where they will receive further assistance.Please be aware that cellular and phone communication is currently extremely limited in the area. We understand the concern and uncertainty this may cause, and we kindly ask for your patience as these rescue efforts will take some time.#NCwx #helene #disaster #NCwxNCwx#helenehelene#disasterdisasterhttps://www.facebook.com/rcemergencymanagement/posts/957006026472158?ref=embed_posthttps://www.facebook.com/rcemergencymanagement/posts/957006026472158?ref=embed_posthttps://www.facebook.com/rcemergencymanagement/posts/957006026472158?ref=embed_post">
