      <node id="113216210133063007" label="ateur radio. From all the past disasters I have been involved with, it's pretty much impossible to get inbound traffic INTO a disaster zone. The only thing you can do is have a ham radio operator send a message OUT of the disaster zone. It pays to either 1) get your license before the disaster and learn how to communicate or 2) live next door to a ham radio operator who is able to send a message out for you. #disasters #NCwx #Helene #DisasterPreparation #hamradio#disastersdisasters#NCwxNCwx#HeleneHelene#DisasterPreparationDisasterPreparation#hamradiohamradio">
