      <node id="113213343798865701" label="urricaneHurricane#TropicalStormTropicalStorm#HeleneHeleneTVA's River Forecast Center has activated a Condition Red Warning for an Imminent Breach at Nolichucky Dam in Greene County. The breach could occur at any time due to extreme rainfall from the remnants of Hurricane Helene.Potentially life-threatening flooding can occur as far downstream as Douglas Reservoir. Local county emergency management officials are coordinating evacuations as appropriate. Please stay alert for notices from your local EMA and heed all warnings. If you are in low lying areas below the Nolichucky Dam, be prepared to get to higher ground.📸  Tennessee Valley Authority (early Friday)">
