      <node id="113214705875589540" label="remnant low of post tropical cyclone Helene is expected to produce an additional 1-2 inches of rainfall across portions of the Ohio Valley through early Sunday, with some isolated 3 inch totals possible.  Most of the rainfall across the central and southern Appalachians has come to an end, although a few lingering showers are possible through Saturday. SURF: Swells generated by Helene will affect much the Atlantic Seaboard from Florida to Long Island NY through Saturday. These swells are likely to cause life-threatening surf and rip currentconditions. Please consult products from your local weather office.">
