      <node id="113212806197363082" label="ent 9:20 EDTSHELTER UPDATE:9/27/24, 9:00 PM: We understand that many of you are deeply concerned about your loved ones during this challenging time, especially given the current communication outages. Phone systems are down across the county, particularly in Lake Lure, making it difficult to verify names with the emergency shelter. Please rest assured that your requests are not being ignored. As communications are restored, we will prioritize confirming names, and your loved ones will be able to reach out to you directly. Your patience and support are greatly appreciated as we navigate these circumstances together.">
