      <node id="113212742288619622" label="TFriday evening Hazardous #ncwx Update#ncwxncwxMany Flash Flood Emergencies, Flash Flood Warnings, and Flood Warnings were issued overnight and through Friday morning across western NC. Preliminary rainfall totals indicate that nearly 30” of rainfall was recorded in Yancey County, with rainfall totals of 10-20” across much of the mountains. Additional light showers are forecast into tomorrow and while not as heavy as previous days, any rainfall on top of already saturated soils will increase the threat for additional flash flooding…">
