      <node id="113212748520374932" label="2 of 4) and Marginal Risk (level 1 of 4) remains in across the mountains through tonight and into Friday morning for any additional rain showers. A Marginal Risk (level 1 of 4) remains in place across portions of the mountains Saturday as additional light rainfall is forecast during the afternoon and evening hours.Widespread minor to major river flooding is ongoing or forecast across western NC but will recede through the weekend and into early next week. Several tornado warnings were issued throughout the day today, with several counties likely conducting damage surveys early next week.">
