      <node id="113209942521215776" label="ncyFlashFloodEmergencyNWS:&quot;* At 1011 AM EDT, Doppler radar and automated rain gauges indicated  thunderstorms producing heavy rain across the warned area. Between  5 and 8 inches of rain have fallen. The expected rainfall rate is  1.5 to 3 inches in 1 hour. Additional rainfall amounts of 2 to 4  inches are possible in the warned area. Flash flooding is already  occurring.  This is a FLASH FLOOD EMERGENCY for Wythe and Carroll Counties.  This is a PARTICULARLY DANGEROUS SITUATION. SEEK HIGHER GROUND NOW!&quot; #VAwx #FlashFloodEmergency #FlashFlood #Helene#VAwxVAwx#FlashFloodEmergencyFlashFloodEmergency#FlashFloodFlashFlood#HeleneHelene">
