      <node id="113205440056613330" label="-Spartanburg SC122 PM EDT Thu Sep 26 2024...CATASTROPHIC FLOODING AND LANDSLIDES FOR THE MOUNTAINS AND FOOTHILLS FROM HURRICANE HELENE...…Record flooding is forecasted and has been compared to the floods of 1916 in the Asheville area. The impacts from this event are expected to be greater than TS Fred from August 2021, the mountains in 2004 from Frances and Ivan, &amp; in Upstate SC the Saluda River Basin flooding from 1949. We plead with everyone that you take every single weather warning very seriously through the entirety of this event as impacts will be life-threatening and make sure to have multiple ways to receive the alerts…">
