      <node id="113205334072786300" label="a, 170 miles off W Florida coast, moving NNE at about 21mph linear, still accelerating slightly. Wind speeds reaching 120mph. Vortex just over 300miles across. Eye well defined, still. Landing projected in 5hrs or so, somewhere W of Dixie County. Surface winds on landing projected at 127-130mph. Surge expected at 20ft, with several hundred feet into land, along Big Bend.">
