      <node id="113204403250323446" label="AANOAA#HeleneHeleneHelene making its way NNE through Gulf of Mexico, somewhere just south of 27degrees N, some 170miles from W #Florida coast, at Cat2 storm. Vortex has coalesced at around 300miles across.#FloridaFloridaNo word, yet, of damages in #Yucatan, but they had a much stronger storm on the Pacific Coast of Mexico.#YucatanYucatanSURGE may be the worst of the Helene, with 18ft of surge expected along the Big Bend coast. #Tampa Bay should see 6-8ft of surge. #TampaTampaStanding by for 11am update.">
