      <node id="113203708841625832" label="ift in the path. The main change/anomaly I’ve seen is that there are concentric eyewalls now, which is messing with their strength forecasts. From my non-meteorologist understanding, an eyewall replacement (later) would be a stronger hurricane, but the double eyewall at the moment is interfering with strengthening. So sort of a wash, and unpredictable. Dangerous in any case. Good luck to you. #Helene@kimlockhartga@kimlockhartgakimlockhartga#HeleneHelene">
