      <node id="113199867417814557" label="In recent years, inland flooding is responsible for the majority of deaths in hurricanes.&quot;-J Bereradelli, Meteorologist &amp; Climate Specialist&quot;Rainfall totals from Helene continue to increase around WNC on overnight model runs.  This is very concerning &amp; I can’t stress enough the flooding threat.  Today is the day to get your plan together.&quot;-Hvward, Meteorologist#ClimateChange#Hurricane#GlobalWarming#NorthCarolina#ClimateChangeClimateChange#HurricaneHurricane#GlobalWarmingGlobalWarming#NorthCarolinaNorthCarolina">
