      <node id="113245080030325719" label="ash) will resume in targeted areas on Monday, October 7. Routes are being determined based on road accessibility and will be shared when available.     Download the AVL Collects app to receive notifications about trash and recycling pickup in your area. You can find the AVL Collects app in Google Play Store of Apple App Store.    There will be no recycling pick up until the recycling plant is operational. Residents should use both recycling and trash carts for household waste. All waste will be collected as trash at this time by both City of Asheville and Curbie vehicles. #Asheville #Trash#AshevilleAsheville#TrashTrash">
