      <node id="113229695006394058" label="Helene. Helene’s flooding destroyed my neighborhood, and my hometown, and caused the loss of hundreds of lives, homes, and businesses. While I am safe staying with family, much of my city, including my house, is without power, water, and other resources. Asheville NC is in desperate need of aid. I urge you to donate, check in with friends and family in Western North Carolina, and work together to organize direct mutural aid convoys and volunteer work.#hurricane #naturaldisasters #wnc #asheville #flood#hurricanehurricane#naturaldisastersnaturaldisasters#wncwnc#ashevilleasheville#floodflood">
