      <node id="113345311210768128" label="olina#BuncombeCountyBuncombeCountyIf you were impacted by Hurricane Helene, you can apply for a one-time benefit to help buy food through the Disaster Supplemental Nutrition Assistance Program (D-SNAP) through October 24, 2024.Call: D-SNAP Virtual Call Center at 1-844-453-1117 from 8 a.m.-4 p.m., Monday through Friday, and from 9 a.m. to noon on Saturday and Sunday. In-person: Buncombe County Health and Human Services at 40 Coxe Ave, Asheville, NC, 28801. Monday through Friday from 8 a.m.-4 p.m., and Saturday and Sunday from 9 a.m. to 2 p.m.While people are encouraged to apply in their county of residence, they can apply in any of the eligible counties.">
