      <node id="113345272572575055" label="olina#BuncombeCountyBuncombeCountyFrom Buncombe County Government on FB: As Buncombe County continues to be under a boil water advisory, please use bottled water or boil all water for drinking, cooking, and brushing your teeth for at least one minute.Important Water Safety Notice ⚠️ Tap water is NOT safe to drink. Boil water vigorously for at least 1 minute before using it for drinking, cooking, or brushing teeth.You CAN use water for:✅ Laundry✅ Showering (avoid swallowing water)✅ Handwashing (not for food prep)✅ Dishwashing (only if the water temp is 170°F or higher)✅ Flushing toilets">
