      <node id="113345262319781291" label="YanceyCountyYanceyCountyFrom Yancey County Emergency MGT on FB: Public Safety Message: Water Advisory…following all safety guidelines is crucial to ensure your water is safe for use:1. Boil Your Water: Bring all water to a rolling boil for at least one minute before using it for drinking, cooking, or brushing your teeth.2. Use Bottled Water: If boiling is not possible, use bottled water for all consumption needs.3. Follow Official Updates: Stay informed by following updates from local health authorities and public safety officials.4. Avoid Contaminated Water: Do not use water from any source that may be contaminated until it has been tested and declared safe…">
