      <node id="113345185986627302" label="ina#HaywoodCountyHaywoodCountyFrom Haywood County Emergency Services on FB: DSNAP Deadline   📣 October 24 📣Hurricane Helene Disaster Supplemental Nutrition Assistance Program (D-SNAP) for Haywood CountyResidents of Haywood County impacted by Helene may be eligible for a one-time benefit to help buy food through the Disaster Supplemental Nutrition Assistance Program (D-SNAP). This program is available for those affected by the storm in 25 western NC counties, including Haywood, and members of the Eastern Band of Cherokee Indians.To be eligible for D-SNAP, applicants must meet the following criteria:">
