      <node id="113339576750234586" label="ather Authority on FB: It's a new day across the state; we can expect more tranquil weather. Happy Sunday, North Carolina! As I look over the morning data, high pressure will control our weather, and temperatures are in the 40s for many this morning. I expect mostly sunny skies with highs in the 70s for most of the state; it'll be a great day. There are no tropical threats to North Carolina!Increased tides are possible at high tide today along the Outer Banks and the rest of the coast due to king tides and a breeze. -Ethan">
