      <node id="113316527059701365" label="t of the remaining rain chances will be along the Outer Banks this afternoon, with only an isolated shower elsewhere across the state. Partly to mostly cloudy skies are expected.  Warmer temps will return Friday into next week, with many areas back in the 70s and even some 80s. For those who are new to this page, I have posted a daily forecast every day for the last 8 years, walking you through the statewide forecast every morning. I have not missed a single day in nearly 9 years, giving you a quick rundown of everything you need to know. -Ethan">
