      <node id="113316523071902688" label="arolina’s Weather Authority on FB: We're looking at one of the coldest days in months across the state since last spring for many. It's a new day across the state; we will see warmer temps by the weekend. Happy Wednesday, North Carolina! Temperatures are in the 30s and 40s right now we will see some warming through the day, but highs will be limited to the 50s to near 60° for most, with 40s across the highest elevations of the mountains. We have a few scattered showers around the state right now; those will gradually shift to mainly Eastern and then Outer Banks parts of the state through early afternoon…">
