      <node id="113277268989455522" label="ather Authority on FB: An A+ day is ahead across the state; a new day is ahead, so make it a great one. Happy Wednesday, North Carolina! Looking over the morning data, it is a quiet morning. We will have high pressure fully in control of our weather. Some high clouds will be around, so partly to mostly sunny skies are expected. It'll be a cool start to the day, but temperatures will warm into the 70s for most areas. Highs in the 60s for parts of the high country. The weather will not impact Hurricane Helene recovery efforts across the mountains.">
