      <node id="113266231669822750" label="ather Authority:… a cold front is coming later today! Happy MON, NC! As I look over the morning data, I see that we have a cold front that'll be moving through the state today. It is a quiet morning with some spotty fog. We will see partly to mostly sunny skies; ahead of the cold front temps will warm into the 70s &amp; 80s… I do think a shower or a storm could develop this late afternoon and evening across parts of Eastern &amp; SE NC along the sea breeze and where the front is, so don't be surprised by that. Once the front clears, temps will fall into the 50s &amp; 40s for most areas tonight, with cooler temps across the state for TUE. -Ethan">
