      <node id="113260032329633462" label="ather Authority on FB: A new day is ahead across the state, but quiet and tranquil weather is expected. Happy Sunday, North Carolina! Looking over the morning observations areas of fog are out there right now. Weak high pressure will build in from the north and northeast through today before a strong cold front arrives Monday. Areas of fog this morning will lead to partly to mostly sunny skies; highs will be in the 70s and low 80s for most areas. It’ll be a dry and quiet day, have a great day. -Ethan">
