      <node id="113283684638286976" label="sion of how strong the #tornado outbreak from #Hurricane #Milton was, how it compares to other hurricanes, and some aspects that made it as severe as it was.#tornadotornado#HurricaneHurricane#MiltonMiltonhttps://ingallswx.com/2024/10/10/hurricane-milton-produces-major-tornado-outbreak-in-florida/ https://ingallswx.com/2024/10/10/hurricane-milton-produces-major-tornado-outbreak-in-florida/https://ingallswx.com/2024/10/10/hurricane-milton-produces-major-tornado-outbreak-in-florida/#weather #FLwx#weatherweather#FLwxFLwx">
        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="2024-10-10 14:50:46+00:00" />
          <attvalue for="1" value="ingalls@mstdn.ca" />
          <attvalue for="2" value="2" />
