      <node id="113282038598681182" label="s the key parts of a flight.“PETER DODGE HX SCI (1950-2023),” the message read.The ashes likely took about eight minutes to reach the surface of the ocean, Marks said.And in those minutes, Dodge finished his last mission. The vortex message noted his final flight tally — 387.&quot;https://www.washingtonpost.com/nation/2024/10/09/hurricane-milton-meteorologist-ashes/https://www.washingtonpost.com/nation/2024/10/09/hurricane-milton-meteorologist-ashes/https://www.washingtonpost.com/nation/2024/10/09/hurricane-milton-meteorologist-ashes/#Hurricane #Milton #Meteorology #Climate #Weather #News #USA #US#HurricaneHurricane#MiltonMilton#MeteorologyMeteorology#ClimateClimate#WeatherWeather#NewsNews#USAUSA#USUS">
