      <node id="113282026833291402" label="ttered in the eye of a #hurricane.#hurricanehurricaneDodge, a #meteorologist who died last year at the age of 73, had flown into the eye of 386 storms during a career that spanned more than four decades...#meteorologistmeteorologistFrank Marks, Dodge’s close friend and colleague, said releasing his ashes into Hurricane #Milton was “a total honor and a great tribute to Peter and all he’s done for us.”&quot;https://www.washingtonpost.com/nation/2024/10/09/hurricane-milton-meteorologist-ashes/ #MiltonMiltonhttps://www.washingtonpost.com/nation/2024/10/09/hurricane-milton-meteorologist-ashes/https://www.washingtonpost.com/nation/2024/10/09/hurricane-milton-meteorologist-ashes/#Climate #Weather #News#ClimateClimate#WeatherWeather#NewsNews">
