      <node id="113280462630946364" label="one who lives in #Florida, I feel like Trump and Elon actively spreading #misinformation about #hurricane relief is a whole new level of abhorrent behavior from politicians.  At a time when we are desperately trying to reach as many affected people as possible with information about what is happening, what they need to do, and what relief and aid will be available during and after the storm, we actually had to stop what we were doing to tell people to stop listening to a fucking PRESIDENTIAL CANDIDATE and MASS MEDIA OWNER.#FloridaFlorida#misinformationmisinformation#hurricanehurricaneThis is a whole new level of insane and dangerous.  There are people whose houses are gone, who are desperately in need of resources, and these assholes are telling them there is only $750 because the rest went to illegals who are eating our pets and the hurricane is being controlled by magic.  #FEMA workers and broadcasters should not have to worry about people saying this about them.#FEMAFEMA">
