      <node id="113273372513967395" label="the house i grew up in Puerto Rico was on a recess at the bottom of a hill. so the street was lower than my house. we had to walk up from the street to get to our front door. for us to have a foot and a half of water in our house meant that outside there were about 8 feet of water that had nowhere to go down the 2 sewer grates in front of our house. and i don't remember evacuating. i just remember waking up to water everywhere.">
