      <node id="113273330860199446" label="is one of my core memories.#hurricanehurricaneMami's grandma survived the tsumani of the early 1900s. Mama J passed on that experience to Nana who passed it to Mami then to me. what we lost was the inevitable but were able to save the basics. when one of my besties lost everything, was able to give her clothes &amp; toys. decades later, she said, she kept them all as a reminder of our friendship.Huracán Eloisa https://es.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hurac%C3%A1n_Eloisa#Referenciashttps://es.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hurac%C3%A1n_Eloisa#Referenciashttps://es.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hurac%C3%A1n_Eloisa#Referencias">
