      <node id="113267936895557391" label="ODEZINFO#HURRICANEHURRICANE#MiltonMiltonIt didn't &quot;explode unexpectedly&quot; to a Cat5. That expected development was in Public Advisory Discussions, from #NHC #NOAA as of early morning. They knew Milton would go to high Cat4-Cat5. #NHCNHC#NOAANOAAIt is NOT gonna &quot;flatten Tampa&quot;. There will be damage. A Cat3-4 hurricane landing near a big urban center is NOT a joke, and IT HAS HAPPENED BEFORE.It *IS* expected to hit wind shearing, disperse energy, and then disperse some more, as it &quot;climbs&quot; the continental shelf (shallower waters, less fuel) and then disperse some more as it lands.Projected to land near Tampa Bay as high Cat3 STOP FLOGGING PANIC, CRETINS. it's dangerous enough as it is, and panic NEVER helps anyone.Allow people to be focused on factual information, provided by people who know what the fuck they are saying, not imbeciles seeking attention.Goddamnit.">
