      <node id="113392888928465058" label=".gov/media/videos/protecting-people-natural-hazards-research-and-monitoring--“Natural hazards like earthquakes, volcanoes, landslides, and floods impact millions of Americans every year. The U.S. Geological Survey monitors these hazards in realtime, giving communities early warnings and critical information. In some cases, forecasting where the threat is greatest and helping reduce the risk to people, homes, and infrastructure. From earthquake early warning to coastal change forecasting, USGS science saves lives and helps protect the economy. Enhancing the safety and resilience of our country. Making us a more Hazard Ready Nation.”#geology #engineeringgeology #naturaldisaster #naturalhazards #earthquakes #volcanoes #landslides #massmovement #flood #flooding #drought #water #hydrology #USA #US #america #impacts #risk #hazard #prediction #warning #information #network #communication #forecasting #threat #infrastructure #coast #coastal #economy #cost #economies #safety #monitoring @USGShttps://www.usgs.gov/media/videos/protecting-people-natural-hazards-research-and-monitoringhttps://www.usgs.gov/media/videos/protecting-people-natural-hazards-research-and-monitoring#geologygeology#engineeringgeologyengineeringgeology#naturaldisasternaturaldisaster#naturalhazardsnaturalhazards#earthquakesearthquakes#volcanoesvolcanoes#landslideslandslides#massmovementmassmovement#floodflood#floodingflooding#droughtdrought#waterwater#hydrologyhydrology#USAUSA#USUS#americaamerica#impactsimpacts#riskrisk#hazardhazard#predictionprediction#warningwarning#informationinformation#networknetwork#communicationcommunication#forecastingforecasting#threatthreat#infrastructureinfrastructure#coastcoast#coastalcoastal#economyeconomy#costcost#economieseconomies#safetysafety#monitoringmonitoring">
