      <node id="113278246042180724" label="rial levels, the researchers calculated, sea level will rise by about 4 cm, or 1.6”. Even a small increase in #SeaLevelRise can lead to more dangerous #flooding when #hurricanes &amp; heavy #rains strike. (In #Florida, which is currently facing the danger of Hurricane #Milton, #SeaLevels are already 8” higher than they were in 1950.)#EarthEarth#SeaLevelRiseSeaLevelRise#floodingflooding#hurricaneshurricanes#rainsrains#FloridaFlorida#MiltonMilton#SeaLevelsSeaLevels#climate #ClimateCrisis #ClimateScience #GlobalWarming #ExtremeWeather #VoteBlue#climateclimate#ClimateCrisisClimateCrisis#ClimateScienceClimateScience#GlobalWarmingGlobalWarming#ExtremeWeatherExtremeWeather#VoteBlueVoteBlue">
